{"id":"b77a2f0af03cd902","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family.md","title":"ZFC Comb7 Localizing Family","display":"df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family — ZFC Comb7 Localizing Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family"],"display":"df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family — ZFC Comb7 Localizing Family","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family — ZFC Comb7 Localizing Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\in V\">\\(\\Phi\\in V\\)</span> (family candidate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\)</span> (real localized by a member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in V\">\\(\\varphi\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\)</span> (finite-width slalom witness)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_0,n\\in\\omega\">\\(n_0,n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (eventual-bound indices)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7LocalizingFamily}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb7LocalizingFamily}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}localizing\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7LocalizingFamily}_S(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\Phi\\subseteq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega)):\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|\\varphi(n)|\\leq n+1)\\}\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\to\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n_0\\leq n\\to f(n)\\in\\varphi(n))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}localizing\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7LocalizingFamily}_S(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\Phi\\subseteq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega)):\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|\\varphi(n)|\\leq n+1)\\}\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\to\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n_0\\leq n\\to f(n)\\in\\varphi(n))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The finite-width requirement prevents a trivial witness such as the constant slalom <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(n)=\\omega\">\\(\\varphi(n)=\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Reals and slaloms are expanded as set-coded function graphs; no undeclared dependent-product carrier is assumed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ 为集合 $A$ 的唯一基数，使用 [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]] 的基数函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega))","display":false},{"tex":"n_0,n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7LocalizingFamily}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}localizing\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7LocalizingFamily}_S(\\Phi)\\leftrightarrow\\Phi\\subseteq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\mathcal P(\\omega)):\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega))\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(|\\varphi(n)|\\leq n+1)\\}\\land\\forall f\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega)\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\omega)\\to\\exists\\varphi\\in\\Phi\\;\\exists n_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(n_0\\leq n\\to f(n)\\in\\varphi(n))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi(n)=\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1599,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1691","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family.md|58-df-zfc-comb7-localizing-family]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}